<section class="layer cover"><div class="eyebrow">A LITTLE NOTE FROM YOUR BEST FRIEND</div><div class="emoji">💌</div><h1>Hey Sosmita!</h1><p class="sub">Please ek baar meri baat dil se sun lena… 🥺💗</p></section>
<section class="layer letter"><span class="tag">LAYER 1 · WHAT I FELT</span><h2>Dil ki baat… ❤️</h2><p>Honestly, mujhe samajh nahi aa raha tha ki sorry kaise bolun, isliye ye chhota sa page tumhare liye banaya hai.</p><p>Mujhe bura lag raha tha kyunki bahut din se humari properly baat nahi ho rahi thi. Main tumhare messages aur calls miss kar raha tha. Jab meri bheji hui reels late seen hoti thi, toh maine galat samajh liya ki shayad tum mujhse baat nahi karna chahti.</p></section>
<section class="layer letter"><span class="tag">LAYER 2 · MY MISTAKE</span><h2>I know I was wrong. 🥺</h2><p>Mujhe apni feelings batane ka better tareeka choose karna chahiye tha. Gusse mein friendship-related reels bhejna, tumhari reels ignore karna aur unfollow kar dena — ye sab meri galti thi.</p><div class="highlight"><strong>I am genuinely sorry, Sosmita. ❤️</strong><br>Tumhari bhi apni life, apna time aur apni priorities hain. Har baar turant reply karna zaroori nahi hai. Mujhe ye samajhna chahiye tha.</div><p>Gusse mein maine keh diya ki ab kabhi disturb nahi karunga, lekin sach ye hai ki main hamari friendship khona nahi chahta. Tum meri best friend ho, aur tumhari friendship mere liye important hai.</p></section>
<section class="layer letter"><span class="tag">LAYER 3 · YOU ARE SPECIAL</span><h2>Ek baat dil se… 💗</h2><p>Mujhe explain karna nahi aata, isliye main khul ke apni feelings bata nahi pata. Tum mere liye bahut hi special ho. Tum kitni special ho, shayad main words mein kabhi bata hi nahi sakta. ❤️</p><p>Aur agar maine gusse mein kuch bhi galat kaha ho ya tumhara dil dukhaya ho, toh please mujhe maaf kar dena. Mera intention tumhe hurt karna nahi tha. 🥺</p></section>
<section class="layer letter"><span class="tag">LAYER 4 · MY PROMISE</span><h2>I'll do better. 🫶</h2><p>Main promise karta hoon ki aage se gusse mein aise react karne ke bajaye calmly baat karne ki koshish karunga. Main chahta hoon ki hum phir se pehle ki tarah baat karein, hasein aur random reels share karein — bina kisi pressure ke.</p><p><strong>I don't expect an instant reply. I just wanted to say sorry from my heart. 💗</strong></p></section>
<section class="layer letter"><span class="tag">LAYER 4 · SOMETHING I CAN'T EXPRESS</span><h2>You are special to me. 💗</h2><p>Mujhe apni feelings explain karna nahi aata, isliye main khul kar kuch keh nahi paata. Tum mere liye bahut hi special ho. Kitni special ho, ye shayad main words mein kabhi bata bhi nahi sakta.</p><div class="highlight"><strong>Aur haan,</strong> agar maine gusse mein kuch bhi galat keh diya ho ya meri kisi baat se tumhe hurt hua ho, toh please mujhe maaf kar dena. 🥺❤️</div></section>
<section class="layer"><span class="tag">LAYER 5 · YOUR CHOICE</span><h2>Can I ask you something? 🌷</h2><p style="text-align:center;line-height:1.7">Whatever you feel, I'll respect it. Choose whichever feels right to you. ❤️</p><div class="choices"><button class="choice-main" onclick="showResponse('Thank you for giving me another chance. I promise to value our friendship and understand you better. 🥹💗')">Give me one more chance 🥺💗</button><button class="choice-soft" onclick="showResponse('I understand. Take all the time you need. I will respect your space. ❤️')">I need some time 🌷</button><button class="choice-soft" onclick="showResponse('I am truly sorry, Sosmita. Thank you for hearing me out. Your friendship means a lot to me. 🥺❤️')">Please forgive me 🥹❤️</button></div><div id="response" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></section>
<section class="layer surprise"><span class="tag">THE LAST LAYER · A LITTLE SURPRISE 🎁</span><h2>A Little Panda Just for You! 🐼💗</h2><p class="sub">Because I know how much you love pandas, Sosmita.</p><img class="panda" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="A cute panda teddy holding a pink heart for Sosmita"><p style="line-height:1.85;max-width:470px;margin:15px auto">This little panda is just for you, Sosmita. Keep smiling, because your smile is special. And please give your silly best friend one more chance. 🥺❤️</p><div class="signature">Your silly best friend, always wishing you well. 💌</div><p class="tiny">No pressure to reply immediately. Your feelings matter too. ♡</p></section>
